{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"Let's evaluate the two sigma expressions and see which of them results in $0 + 0.25 + 0.5 + 0.75$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}\\displaystyle\\sum_{m=0}^3\\left(\\dfrac{m}{4}\\right)\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\left[\\dfrac{(0)}{4}\\right]+\\left[\\dfrac{(1)}{4}\\right]+\\left[\\dfrac{(2)}{4}\\right]+\\left[\\dfrac{(3)}{4}\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=0 + 0.25 + 0.5 + 0.75\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\u0026\\phantom{=}\\displaystyle\\sum_{m=1}^4\\left(\\dfrac{2m}{8}\\right)\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\left[\\dfrac{2(1)}{8}\\right]+\\left[\\dfrac{2(2)}{8}\\right]+\\left[\\dfrac{2(3)}{8}\\right]+\\left[\\dfrac{2(4)}{8}\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=0.25 + 0.5 + 0.75 + 1\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion, only $\\displaystyle\\sum_{m=0}^3\\left(\\dfrac{m}{4}\\right)$ is equal to $0 + 0.25 + 0.5 + 0.75$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"Consider the sum $0 + 0.25 + 0.5 + 0.75$.\n\n**Which expression is equal to the above sum?**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"$\\displaystyle\\sum_{m=0}^3\\left(\\dfrac{m}{4}\\right)$","correct":true},{"content":"$\\displaystyle\\sum_{m=1}^4\\left(\\dfrac{2m}{8}\\right)$","correct":false},{"content":"","isNoneOfTheAbove":true}],"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":true,"multipleSelect":true,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
